{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yanachen1314/Agent-Monitor/pulls/1","id":4201312281,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTpI3ss76avAZ","html_url":"https://github.com/yanachen1314/Agent-Monitor/pull/1","diff_url":"https://github.com/yanachen1314/Agent-Monitor/pull/1.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/yanachen1314/Agent-Monitor/pull/1.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yanachen1314/Agent-Monitor/issues/1","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yanachen1314/Agent-Monitor/pulls/1/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yanachen1314/Agent-Monitor/pulls/1/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yanachen1314/Agent-Monitor/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yanachen1314/Agent-Monitor/issues/1/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/yanachen1314/Agent-Monitor/statuses/ad82cddf3bce209d9d404d1f75170129af8f509c","number":1,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"feat: 改进 macOS 原生支持与发布流程","user":{"login":"feiwubill","id":32639800,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNjM5ODAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32639800?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiwubill","html_url":"https://github.com/feiwubill","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiwubill/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiwubill/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiwubill/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiwubill/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiwubill/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiwubill/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiwubill/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiwubill/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiwubill/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## 变更内容\n\n- 将 macOS 本地构建与正式发布构建拆分：\n  - `npm run build:mac`：仅构建 Apple Silicon arm64，使用 ad-hoc 签名且不公证，供本机测试。\n  - `npm run build:mac:release`：要求 Developer ID 签名身份和完整的 Apple 公证凭据，缺失时在编译前退出。\n- GitHub Actions 的 macOS 发布任务改用正式发布配置，避免无签名或未公证的安装包被误当作公开版本。\n- 修复登录启动的跨平台配置：macOS 使用 `mainAppService`，Windows 保留 `--hidden` 参数，并正确识别 macOS 的 `wasOpenedAtLogin`。\n- macOS 使用原生 `hiddenInset` 标题栏和红黄绿窗口按钮；Windows/Linux 继续使用原有自定义窗口按钮。\n- 调整 macOS 单行品牌区域的间距和图标尺寸。\n- 增加发布凭据、登录项与窗口样式的单元测试，并补充构建说明。\n\n## 背景\n\n原配置会同时生成 x64 与 arm64 包，macOS 登录项也沿用了 Windows 参数；无边框窗口在 macOS 上还会显示 Windows 风格的窗口控件。本 PR 将构建目标收敛到 Apple Silicon，并补齐 macOS 原生行为和正式发布安全边界。\n\n## 验证\n\n- `npm run typecheck`\n- `npm run lint`\n- `npm test`：18 个测试文件、54 项测试通过\n- 对本 PR 的 19 个变更文件执行 Prettier 检查\n- `npm run build:mac` 成功生成 arm64 DMG\n- `file` 确认为 Mach-O arm64\n- `codesign --verify --deep --strict` 通过（本地包为 ad-hoc 签名）\n- `hdiutil verify` 通过\n\n正式发布构建需要项目维护者配置 Apple Developer 签名与公证凭据，因此本 PR 未在本机执行正式签名、公证，也未包含任何 DMG 二进制文件。\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-08-04T07:53:47Z","updated_at":"2026-08-04T07:53:47Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"568c7cd7fec466f5c966b1b8f1d391cf2d20acb7","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"feiwubill:agent/macos-support","ref":"agent/macos-support","repo":{"id":1322423117,"node_id":"R_kgDOTtKTTQ","name":"Agent-Monitor","full_name":"feiwubill/Agent-Monitor","owner":{"login":"feiwubill","id":32639800,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNjM5ODAw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/32639800?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiwubill","html_url":"https://github.com/feiwubill","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiwubill/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiwubill/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiwubill/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/feiwubill/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.co